        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>古诗思想感情手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mvn-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f6f4ec;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"Kaiti SC\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(\n        to bottom,\n        #f6f4ec 0px,\n        #f6f4ec 27px,\n        #c9c6bb 27px,\n        #c9c6bb 28px\n      );\n    padding: 8px 14px 60px 10px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    min-height: 720px;\n  }\n  /* red vertical margin line as seen on the notebook paper */\n  .margin-line {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    left: 262px;\n    width: 1px;\n    background: #d98a9c;\n    opacity: 0.6;\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 1;\n  }\n  .title {\n    flex: 0 0 118px;\n    color: #d2691e;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n    text-align: left;\n    padding-left: 4px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .title.pink { color: #e0708f; }\n  .desc {\n    flex: 1 1 auto;\n    color: #4a3f2f;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 28px;\n  }\n  .desc .indent2 { display: block; text-indent: 2em; }\n  .desc .indent3 { display: block; text-indent: 3em; }\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 14px;\n    bottom: 8px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #8a8578;\n  }\n  .placeholder {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 16px;\n    bottom: 30px;\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border: 1px dashed #b9b4a6;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    color: #8a8578;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"margin-line\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;咏鹅&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对于我国的喜爱赞美之情</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;江南&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对江南的采莲热爱，也激发着读者对<span class=\"indent2\">那朵明风光的向往</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;画&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对画中美好事物的向往和对现实的忧伤</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;小池农&gt;&gt;[?]</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对于农人辛勤劳作的赞美之情，同时也表<span class=\"indent2\">达出作者对农夫的同情</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;古朗月行&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对儿童的天真烂漫，及他们丰富的想象力<span class=\"indent2\">的喜爱之情</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;风&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对大自然的敬畏之情</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;春晓&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对春天的热爱和惋惜之情，抒发了诗人<span class=\"indent2\">热爱春天、珍惜春光的思想感情。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;赠汪伦&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了李白对汪伦的深厚情谊</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;静夜思&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人在寂静的夜晚思念家乡的思想感情</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;寻隐者不遇&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对隐者生活的向往之情，体现了他追求自<span class=\"indent2\">春朴劣省的生活和淡泊的心境。</span>[?]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;池上&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了诗人对诗中小主人公的天真幼稚相、活泼淘气的<span class=\"indent2\">形象的喜爱，以及对田园生活的赞美之情。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;小池&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对大自然景物的喜爱之情</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;画鸡&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对优美高洁雄鸡的赞美与喜爱之情</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title\">&lt;&lt;梅花&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者坚持自我的信念，说明坚强高洁的人格<span class=\"indent2\">所具有的伟大魅力</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;小儿垂钓&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表达了作者对孩童的喜爱之情，也表达了对于小孩<span class=\"indent2\">认真态度的敬佩之情。</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\">\n    <div class=\"title pink\">&lt;&lt;登鹳雀楼&gt;&gt;</div>\n    <div class=\"desc\">表现出诗人不凡的胸襟和抱负，表达了诗人昂扬向上<span class=\"indent2\">的进取精神</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Logo: bottom-right<br>小红书]</div>\n  <div class=\"footer\">小红书号：4130673107</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
